{"hw":"Ἀπολλόδωρος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Ἀπολλόδωρος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ἀπολλόδωρος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, pr. n., <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Apollodorus,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.20</span> </span>, etc.:—hence <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπολ-δώρειος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span> <span class=\"gk\">, αἵρεσις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.4.3</span> </span>.</div></div>"}